WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.049 --> 00:00:05.230
The one piece manga just dropped an ABSOLUTE
BANGER because FOR THE FIRST TIME EVER we

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:11.139
saw the full devil fruit transformation of
one of the legendary Gorosei.

00:00:11.139 --> 00:00:17.930
And let me tell you this was SHOCKING in more
ways than one because not only does Saint

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:25.910
Saturn appear to be some demon bull from Japanese
legend, but we also saw some mind-blowing

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:32.660
magical abilities that honestly I have no
logical explanation for.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:37.800
But that doesn’t mean we won’t try to
die deep into speculation later on, but that’s

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:44.280
not all this chapter revealed because it appears
that Bonney and Saint Saturn have major beef

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:50.870
to settle because when she came face to face
with him she LOST HER MIND and straight up

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:52.640
stabbed the Gorosei in the chest.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:53.969
Like damn.

00:00:53.969 --> 00:00:58.829
She is not messing around.

00:00:58.829 --> 00:01:05.070
On top of all that, Luffy and Kizaru continued
their epic brawl, with Luffy even busting

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:08.210
out some new Gear 5 techniques.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:13.490
But even that is not enough to bring down
Kizaru because the admiral got away from Luffy

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:16.880
again and nearly wiped out the main Stella
Vegapunk.

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:21.850
And honestly, I’m starting to sweat a bit
about how this is going to go because when

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:27.420
Luffy ran out of time for Gear 5 at the end
of this chapter that now puts the straw hats

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:31.610
and the rest of the allies in a TERRIBLE SITUATION.

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.560
With Saint Saturn and Kizaru still ready to
fight, this could turn out WAY WORSE than

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.420
we ever thought possible.

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:40.350
Speaking of the always chill admiral though…

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:46.340
I mean, don’t have to tell you, but man,
Kizaru is just one of the most stylish characters

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:47.930
in the entire story.

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:49.590
The suit, the golden glasses.

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:51.630
The entire Mafia style that he has going.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:57.380
I mean if you’re like me, you probably wished
you could have a pice of that drip cake here.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:02.350
And luckily today’s Sponsor Holzkern, has
made this dream come true for both me AND

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:03.350
you.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:08.910
Now you probably know of Holzkern’s products,
because I wear them in pretty much all of

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:09.910
my videos.

00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:15.990
You might have seen this beautiful watch and
you DEFINITELY know this insane necklace,

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.819
that I just wear…like always.

00:02:17.819 --> 00:02:22.050
And I think it speaks for the quality of a
sponsor when you actually love to use their

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.820
items on a daily basis.

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:30.349
And not only are they insanely stylish, Holzkern’s
entire concept also revolves around helping

00:02:30.349 --> 00:02:34.300
the environment, using a lot of beautiful
natural stone and wood in their products which

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:38.099
in a really nice way makes you feel closer
and connected to nature.

00:02:38.099 --> 00:02:42.909
Their watches are just insanely beautifully
crafted, but they also have accessories like

00:02:42.909 --> 00:02:48.710
rings, bracelets, earrings and maybe most
importantly sunglasses, so you can actually

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:55.550
get some of Kizaru’s drip by getting your
own pair using the link in the description

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:56.550
below.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:04.630
Which actually brings me back to the video,
where before we get to anything else WE HAVE

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:09.299
TO TALK ABOUT Saint Saturn and the chaos we
witnessed in this chapter.

00:03:09.299 --> 00:03:16.659
Because I am still trying to wrap my brain
around what we just saw, but I’ll try my

00:03:16.659 --> 00:03:22.670
best to explain everything we know and can
guess about Saint Saturn’s abilities.

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:30.090
First, we see this incredible magical circle
with a five pointed star suddenly appear in

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:34.840
the middle of the island, and then right after
this Saint Saturn makes his first moves on

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:35.840
the island.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:42.930
Now before we get to man himself, we have
to discuss this diagram because of the MASSIVE

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:46.950
CLUES it can give us about Saturn and even
the other Gorosei.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:52.409
First, we don’t actually know if Saturn
himself created this magic circle or if the

00:03:52.409 --> 00:03:57.489
circle was somehow necessary for Saturn to
make his transformation, which we’ll discuss

00:03:57.489 --> 00:03:59.290
in full detail in just a moment.

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:04.379
I mean the easy thing to say is that Saturn’s
powers made the circle appear, but I also

00:04:04.379 --> 00:04:08.820
wonder if maybe someone like the world’s
secret ruler, Imu, created this circle and

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:11.260
that allowed Saturn to transform.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:17.060
It isn’t that wildly impossible since back
in chapter 1085 when we first saw silhouettes

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:22.500
of the Gorosei’s transformation, Imu was
also present and using their mysterious powers

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:25.000
before the Gorosei all transformed.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:30.030
However, just as important as who made the
circle is what it can tell us about Saturn’s

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.030
powers.

00:04:31.030 --> 00:04:35.490
Now this circle and five-pointed star symbol
is called a pentagram or pentacle, and let

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:42.150
me tell you it is a massive rabbit hole of
religious and cult symbolism which I already

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:46.160
dove headfirst into so that you don’t have
to - you’re welcome - but interestingly

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:51.970
enough this symbol has many different meanings
that you may not be aware of.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:57.199
Of course, recently pop culture has basically
associated an upside down five-pointed star

00:04:57.199 --> 00:05:01.350
with things like devil-worship and the occult,
but if you go back further in history there

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:04.490
is a lot more to discover about this sacred
symbol.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:10.040
For example, in some religious systems, the
five pointed star represents harmony with

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.639
nature and the universe.

00:05:11.639 --> 00:05:17.810
And it was even used in the Christian church
to represent good deeds and charity.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:22.950
But the most interesting connection, and the
one that makes the most sense for One Piece,

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:28.310
is the star’s association with five umm…
let’s call them elements.

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:32.330
Those being Earth, Air, Water, Spirit, and
Fire.

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:34.700
Now why is this important?

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:39.470
Well for one this magic circle and star appeared
along with an explosion of black lightning

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:43.580
and fire, which I’ll connect to Saint Saturn
more specifically in just a moment.

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:49.900
But first, before we even get to see the transformed
world noble we get this super creepy warning

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:56.130
that anyone below the rank of Rear Admiral
is FORBIDDEN from looking at Saint Saturn

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:57.490
and his transformation.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:04.639
And when I first heard this I was thinking
“What?

00:06:04.639 --> 00:06:07.210
That’s a super specific command.

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:10.850
Surely if someone looked they would just get
demoted or something, right?”

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:11.850
BUT NO!

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:20.270
WE GOT THIS !This poor dude just looked at
the man and his head literally exploded.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.330
Like what???????

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:22.330
My jaw dropped.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:27.460
I mean, if I can be honest this felt like
some kind of cursed energy technique from

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:31.069
JuJutsu Kaisen, not a devil fruit power from
One Piece.

00:06:31.069 --> 00:06:34.460
Seriously though, this just brings up a ton
of questions.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:38.090
Like was this truly an unbreakable spell caused
by the magic circle?

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:43.000
Or was it some power that Saint Saturn can
use based on the commands that he gives?

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.720
And what about the Straw Hats and other allies?

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:48.060
Will they be affected by this rule?

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:52.360
Because you might be able to argue that someone
like Usopp or Nami is probably weaker than

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:53.470
a Rear Admiral.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.470
Man, please Oda no, don’t do that to me.

00:06:56.470 --> 00:07:01.860
But it also makes me wonder why it is specifically
Read Admirals and above that aren’t affected.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:04.970
Is it because they have some mastery of haki?

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:07.380
Or some other specific reason?

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:13.270
I don’t know, but that’s enough about
evil curses and magic diagrams, let’s get

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:14.420
to the man himself.

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:18.710
And wow, I was shocked when I saw his full
form.

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:24.460
That’s because when we first saw the silhouettes
in chapter 1085 he had horns, so I originally

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:30.860
thought he might have some sort of Minotaur-like
mythical zoan, but clearly not.

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:36.840
Instead, his appearance is very similar to
the Japanese yokai, Ushi-Oni, which is basically

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.650
a demon cow or bull.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.870
So what do we know about these mythical creatures?

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:47.020
Well, they're super creepy, for one with their
spider-like lower bodies and bull horns.

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:51.569
Kinda reminds me of Black Maria from Kaido’s
crew, but other than that there is honestly

00:07:51.569 --> 00:07:55.220
not a whole lot about these creatures.

00:07:55.220 --> 00:08:01.050
Japanese mythology states that they were incredibly
vicious and would attack and eat humans anytime

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:02.050
they could.

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:06.819
And while they don’t appear to have any
special abilities, they usually lived near

00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:11.860
water and would even sometimes work with other
yokai like these serpent women in order to

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:14.060
capture more prey.

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:23.360
And that’s about it from the mythology,
but there is one other super important detail

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:24.449
we simply must discuss.

00:08:24.449 --> 00:08:30.030
So let’s jump back to the actual view we
get of Saturn because he also has this mysterious

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:35.800
flame-shaped pattern on his lower spider body,
which brings us back to the five elemental

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:42.990
abilities that might be connected to the five
pointed star.

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:47.340
Because like we said the star appeared with
a burst of fire, so it makes me wonder if

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:52.350
Saturn can also use fire-based abilities alongside
his spider-bull transformation.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:57.070
Which would also make sense with the marines
head exploding, because out of all of those

00:08:57.070 --> 00:09:01.990
elements, fire would seem the most likely
to cause that kind of damage.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:07.940
So wow, on top of already having Kizaru and
his light abilities, the straw hats may now

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:12.209
also be dealing with a rampaging, fire-using,
spider bull.

00:09:12.209 --> 00:09:16.200
Sheesh, I definitely would not want to be
on that island right now.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:28.160
But on top of the fire, Saint Saturn has clearly
awakened his zoan devil fruit, as we see by

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.880
the cloud scarf.

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:35.529
This is the same indicator for awakened zoans
that we’ve seen with Luffy’sGear 5, as

00:09:35.529 --> 00:09:38.240
well as the two secret agents from earlier
in the arc.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:42.329
Now beyond his powers, the magical star also
appeared with the number five, which makes

00:09:42.329 --> 00:09:46.399
me wonder if there is a ranking or order system
to the Gorosei.

00:09:46.399 --> 00:09:51.760
And if that is the case, then it makes sense
for Saturn to be the fifth ranking.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:56.060
But does that mean he is the weakest or the
most powerful?

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:57.060
Who knows at this point?

00:09:57.060 --> 00:10:00.600
I’m just still trying to figure out what
happened to that poor dude’s head.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:06.390
And I’d say that this is honestly the very
first time that I’m feeling actual, legit

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:30.490
danger for the straw hat crew in a long, long
time.

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:35.800
I mean this is just some weird stuff happening,
but what’s not weird is you subscribing

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:39.400
to the channel for more one piece content
just like this.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:44.990
However, all that danger didn’t stop Bonney
from straight up stabbing Saint Saturn in

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:51.060
the chest at the end of the chapter because
of some memory she had about her father’s

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:52.340
transformation into a cyborg.

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:57.700
So clearly there is some major conflict brewing
between these two, but this scene also clearly

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:00.170
shows he can be damaged.

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:05.029
Although I wouldn’t be surprised AT ALL
if he just brushes off this attack like nothing

00:11:05.029 --> 00:11:07.550
and even heals the damage in the very next
chapter.

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:12.190
Now, you might be thinking that’s all we
learned about the Gorosei from this chapter,

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:17.790
but let’s take all this that we learned
about Saturn and try to apply it to the other

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:18.790
Gorosei.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:21.500
Because if we are sticking with this theme
of five elements - which of course could be

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:26.959
wrong, but it seems like a strong theory at
this point - then what abilities might the

00:11:26.959 --> 00:11:28.060
other four have?

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:33.399
Well, just going off of the clearest images
we got from chapter 1085 we have some idea

00:11:33.399 --> 00:11:36.820
of what the others’ zoan transformation
could look like.

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:41.750
And when we compare it to how they were standing
earlier in the chapter, we can say that Saint

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:47.310
Warcury on the far right looks like some kind
of animal with a large tusk or horn, which

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:50.310
could be an elephant or rhino type transformation.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:59.589
And to me that fits pretty well with an earth
ability.

00:11:59.589 --> 00:12:03.889
Right next to him is Saint Mars, who looks
like some sort of bird which goes perfectly

00:12:03.889 --> 00:12:05.139
with an Air power.

00:12:05.139 --> 00:12:09.500
Moving around we have the most human looking
transformation which is Saint Nasujurou.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:14.160
And honestly I'm not too sure if he could
represent Water or Spirit, and the same could

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:19.500
be said for Saint Juu Peter who just looks
like a blob with a large open mouth.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:24.230
So not exactly clear about these too, but
the most disappointing part is that we still

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:30.010
can’t really pin down what their actual
devil fruit transformations will be like.

00:12:30.010 --> 00:12:36.449
I mean we already thought they would be mythical
zoans, and now we know they might all be based

00:12:36.449 --> 00:12:39.699
on Japanese legends, but which ones exactly…

00:12:39.699 --> 00:12:42.980
well it is still too hard to know, for now.

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:54.810
But with this first hint of the Gorosei’s
mind-bending powers, we finally know how the

00:12:54.810 --> 00:13:03.300
World Government has stayed in power for centuries.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:11.720
And if you want a complete breakdown of the
entire world government system as well as

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:16.970
ALL, and I mean ALL, of the incredible military
forces they command, you can watch this video

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:18.560
right here.

